WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.700
Setting up the work table

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:11.800
1. Put the phone on the edge of the table with its camera pointing out.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:19.800
2. Under the phone's camera put the work stool, on which the book rests.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:27.800
3. Behind it put the operator's chair.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:35.800
4. At the table's edge, under its middle, fix the cold-light lamp.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:43.800
5. The remote can have a long cord worn round the neck, so it is always at hand.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:52.000
Mind the light: no other strong sources in the room, only weak ambient light. Otherwise reflections and shadows appear.
